-evaluation/","tagSlugs":["/tags/machine-learning/","/tags/a-i/","/tags/data-science/"]},"frontmatter":{"title":"Model Evaluation","date":"2019-08-28T23:46:37.121","description":"In which I describe commonly used techniques for evaluating machine learning models. ","tags":["Machine Learning","A.I.","Data Science"]}}},{"node":{"fields":{"slug":"/posts/machine-learning-ensembling/","tagSlugs":["/tags/machine-learning/","/tags/a-i/","/tags/data-science/"]},"frontmatter":{"title":"Join the Ensemble","date":"2019-08-28T23:46:37.121","description":"In which I discuss the technique of ensembling which is used to improve the performance of a single machine learning model by combining the power of several other models.","tags":["Machine Learning","A.I.","Data Science"]}}},{"node":{"fields":{"slug":"/posts/machine-learning-model-selection/","tagSlugs":["/tags/machine-learning/","/tags/a-i/","/tags/data-science/"]},"frontmatter":{"title":"Why Did You Choose This Model?","date":"2019-08-28T23:46:37.121","description":"I discuss strategies such as cross-validation which are used for selecting best-performing machine learning models.","tags":["Machine Learning","A.I.","Data Science"]}}},{"node":{"fields":{"slug":"/posts/principal-components-analysis/","tagSlugs":["/tags/machine-learning/","/tags/a-i/","/tags/data-science/"]},"frontmatter":{"title":"Principal Components Analysis","date":"2019-08-25T23:46:37.121","description":"In which I give a primer on principal components analysis, a commonly used technique for dimensionality reduction in machine learning.","tags":["Machine Learning","A.I.","Data Science"]}}},{"node":{"fields":{"slug":"/posts/feature-selection/","tagSlugs":["/tags/machine-learning/","/tags/a-i/","/tags/data-science/"]},"frontmatter":{"title":"What Features Do You Want?","date":"2019-08-25T23:46:37.121","description":"In which I discuss feature selection which is used in machine learning to help improve model generalization, reduce feature dimensionality, and do